    <description>This flow is to update the &apos;Welcome Call Attempt&apos; Counter(field: Total Welcome Call Completed on Case object) and update field &apos;Date Initial Welcome Call&apos; on the NCSP Record Types when the Task like &apos;Welcome Call Attempt %&apos; gets completed.
